+
+# geno-notes-notes-capture
+
+Append a timestamped journal entry to `journal/YYYY/YYYY-MM.{md,jsonl}` in the active scope. If `--task` is given, also appends a backlink to the task's `## Journal refs` section.
+
+## Usage
+
+```bash
+geno-notes note "<text>" [--task <pattern>] [--kind note|finding|decision|bug|milestone] [--global|--project]
+```
+
+## Input
+
+`$ARGUMENTS` are passed directly to `geno-notes note`.
+
+## Entry kinds
+
+| Kind | Use for |
+|------|---------|
+| `note` | General observation (default) |
+| `finding` | Discovery worth remembering |
+| `decision` | Architectural or design choice |
+| `bug` | Bug found or fixed |
+| `milestone` | Meaningful progress marker |
+
+## Examples
+
+```bash
+geno-notes note "OAuth scope 'user:email' is insufficient" --task auth --kind finding
+geno-notes note "Switched to RS256 for JWT signing" --kind decision
+geno-notes note "All tests passing after refactor" --kind milestone
+```
+
+## Completion
+
+When this skill finishes, emit a trace:
+
+```bash
+geno-trace emit \
+  --skill geno-notes-notes-capture \
+  --status <success|failure|abandoned> \
+  --tool-calls <approximate count> \
+  --errors <count of tool/command errors>
+```
