+
+# geno-notes-site-lint
+
+Health-check synthesis pages against primary sources. Dispatches to `geno-notes lint`.
+
+## Usage
+
+```bash
+geno-notes lint [--global|--project]
+```
+
+## Input
+
+`$ARGUMENTS` are passed directly to `geno-notes lint`.
+
+## Checks performed
+
+- **Stale pages** — synthesis pages superseded by newer tasks/journal entries
+- **Orphan pages** — synthesis pages with no inbound wikilinks
+- **Missing pages** — wikilink targets that have no corresponding page
+- **Gaps** — important topics in sources without a synthesis page
+- **Contradictions** — synthesis pages conflicting with each other or source material
+- **Dead references** — citations to task IDs or journal entries that no longer exist
+
+## Examples
+
+```bash
+geno-notes lint
+geno-notes lint --global
